//   PageRankPullGS.
// The neighbour load is post-indexed, a macro-op in gem5 (load, then a
//   MicroAddXiUop for x0): both micro-ops match the PC, the load tags x1
//   (the chain), the add tags x0 (unused), so producer instance ids
//   advance by two per neighbour.
offset: 0
func PageRankPullGS_omp_fn_1:
